:"paragraph","text":"えーとえーと、リーゼント！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごくやってやたい！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか...すごくかっこいい！！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/09/15/5013263/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いかつい顔、こんな感じかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お口が生意気。"}],"source":"archive"}